874
00:54:53,668 --> 00:54:56,668
♪ Quatro folhinhas num morro de trevo,

875
00:54:56,668 --> 00:54:59,668
♪ Feliz onde as patas sossegam o passo.

876
00:54:59,668 --> 00:55:02,668
